        "kind": "home",
        "lang": "en",
        "markdown": "[Home](/) · [Menu](/menu) · [Reservations](/reservations) · [Contact](/contact)\n\n# The Lorient Grill\n\n**Wood-fired steaks and local catch, steps from Lorient beach.**\n\nOpen since 2011, The Lorient Grill is run by chef Daniel Okafor and his wife Priya, who looks after the dining room and the wine list.\n\n## Hours\n\nDinner only, Tuesday to Sunday, 6:30pm–10:30pm. Closed Mondays.\n\n## Private events\n\nWe host rehearsal dinners and birthdays for up to 40 guests. Set menus from €95 per person.\n\n## Reviews from our guests\n\n\"The ribeye was perfect and Priya picked a wonderful wine for us.\" — Mark & Susan, Boston\n\n## Contact\n\nThe Lorient Grill, Route de Lorient, 97133 Saint-Barthélemy\nCall +590 590 00 24 56 or email book@lorientgrill.example\n\nReserve online with Resy: https://resy.example/the-lorient-grill\n\nWe speak English and French. Free parking behind the restaurant.\n\n© The Lorient Grill · Legal notice · Cookie policy"
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "url": "https://lorientgrill.example/menu",
        "kind": "menu",
        "lang": "en",
        "markdown": "[Home](/) · [Menu](/menu) · [Reservations](/reservations) · [Contact](/contact)\n\n# Dinner menu\n\nPrices in euros, service included.\n\n## Starters\n\n- Burrata, heirloom tomatoes, basil oil — €19\n- Tuna tataki, sesame, ponzu — €24\n- Soup of the day — €14\n\n## From the grill\n\n- Ribeye 350 g — €48\n- Filet mignon 220 g — €46\n- Catch of the day — €36\n- Grilled lobster (market price)\n\n## Sides\n\n- Truffle fries — €9\n- Grilled vegetables — €8\n\n## Desserts\n\n- Chocolate fondant — €13\n- Coconut panna cotta — €12\n\nVegetarian and gluten-free options available on request.\n\n© The Lorient Grill"
      }
    ]
